  "ruleText": "Agr 1902.02 “Commissioner” means the New Hampshire commissioner of agriculture, markets & food.\n\nSource. #1708, eff 4-3-81; ss by #2175, eff 11-30-82; ss by #2860, eff 9-24-84, EXPIRED 9-24-90\n\nNew. #4957, eff 10-19-90; ss by #6272, eff 6-25-96, EXPIRED: 6-25-04\n\nNew. #8143, eff 8-24-04; ss by #8824, eff 2-23-07; ss by #8912, eff 6-20-07, EXPIRED: 6-20-15\n\nNew. #12475, INTERIM, eff 2-2-18, EXPIRES: 8-1-18; ss by #12555, eff 6-21-18 (formerly Agr 1901.02)",
